0/90; Bullet), Loading</td><td>Vex</td><td>3 lb.</td><td>250 GP</td></tr></table>"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.034, 0.952, 0.054, 0.968], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "91"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.102, 0.951, 0.375, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "System Reference Document 5.2.1"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 91, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.101, 0.051, 0.204, 0.073], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Armor"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.1, 0.076, 0.482, 0.124], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "The Armor table lists the game’s main armor. The table includes the cost and weight of armor, as well as the following details:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.102, 0.129, 0.49, 0.19], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Category.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Every type of armor falls into a category: Light, Medium, or Heavy. The category determines how long it takes to don or doff the armor (as shown in the table)."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.102, 0.19, 0.483, 0.267], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Armor Class (AC).", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The table’s Armor Class column tells you what your base AC is when you wear a type of armor. For example, if you wear Leather Armor, your base AC is 11 plus your Dexterity modifier, whereas your AC is 16 in Chain Mail."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.102, 0.267, 0.483, 0.343], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Strength.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " If the table shows a Strength score in the Strength column for an armor type, that armor reduces the wearer’s speed by 10 feet unless the wearer has a Strength score equal to or higher than the listed score."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.102, 0.343, 0.483, 0.391], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Stealth.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " If the table shows “Disadvantage” in the Stealth column for an armor type, the wearer has Disadvantage on Dexterity (Stealth) checks."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.523, 0.051, 0.695, 0.07], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Armor Training"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.521, 0.075, 0.899, 0.168], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Anyone can don armor or hold a Shield, but only those with training can use them effectively, as explained below. A character’s class and other features determine the character’s armor training. A monster has training with any armor in its stat block."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.523, 0.175, 0.82, 0.192], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Light, Medium, or Heavy Armor"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.521, 0.193, 0.909, 0.256], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "If you wear Light, Medium, or Heavy armor and lack training with it, you have Disadvantage on any D20 Test that involves Strength or Dexterity, and you can’t cast spells."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.523, 0.262, 0.586, 0.278], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Shield"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.521, 0.279, 0.9, 0.312], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "You gain the Armor Class benefit of a Shield only if", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " you have training with it."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.523, 0.318, 0.684, 0.336], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "One at a Time"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.522, 0.341, 0.91, 0.374], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "A creature can wear only one suit of armor at a time and wield only one Shield at a time."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.101, 0.409, 0.165, 0.424], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Armor"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "table", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.104, 0.426, 0.91, 0.774], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.104, 0.426, 0.91, 0.774], "content": "<table><tr><td>Armor</td><td>Armor Class (AC)</td><td>Strength</td><td>Stealth</td><td>Weight</td><td>Cost</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\">Light Armor (I Minute to Don or Doff)</td></tr><tr><td>Padded Armor</td><td>II1 + Dex modifier</td><td></td><td>Disadvantage</td><td>8 lb.</td><td>5 GP</td></tr><tr><td>Leather Armor</td><td>II + Dex modifier</td><td></td><td></td><td>10 lb.</td><td>10 GP</td></tr><tr><td>Studded Leather Armor</td><td>12 + Dex modifier</td><td></td><td></td><td>13 lb.</td><td>45 GP</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\">Medium Armor (5 Minutes to Don and I Minute to Doff)</td></tr><tr><td>Hide Armor</td><td>12 + Dex modifier (max 2)</td><td></td><td></td><td>12 lb.</td><td>10 GP</td></tr><tr><td>Chain Shirt</td><td>13 + Dex modifier (max 2)</td><td></td><td></td><td>20 lb.</td><td>50 GP</td></tr><tr><td>Scale Mail</td><td>14 + Dex modifier (max 2)</td><td></td><td>Disadvantage</td><td>45 lb.</td><td>50 GP</td></tr><tr><td>Breastplate</td><td>14 + Dex modifier (max 2)</td><td></td><td></td><td>20 lb.</td><td>400 GP</td></tr><tr><td>Half Plate Armor</td><td>15 + Dex modifier (max 2)</td><td></td><td>Disadvantage</td><td>40 lb.</td><td>750 GP</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\">Heavy Armor (10 Minutes to Don and 5 Minutes to Doff)</td></tr><tr><td>Ring Mail</td><td>14</td><td></td><td>Disadvantage</td><td>40 lb.</td><td>30 GP</td></tr><tr><td>Chain Mail</td><td>16</td><td>Str 13</td><td>Disadvantage</td><td>55 lb.</td><td>75 GP</td></tr><tr><td>Splint Armor</td><td>17</td><td>Str 15</td><td>Disadvantage</td><td>60 lb.</td><td>200 GP</td></tr><tr><td>Plate Armor</td><td>18</td><td>Str 15</td><td>Disadvantage</td><td>65 lb.</td><td>1,500 GP</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\">Shield (Utilize Action to Don or Doff)</td></tr><tr><td>Shield</td><td>+2</td><td></td><td></td><td>6 lb.</td><td>10 GP</td></tr></table>"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.033, 0.952, 0.058, 0.967], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "92"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.102, 0.952, 0.375, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "System Reference Document 5.2.1"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 92, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.102, 0.051, 0.184, 0.073], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Tools"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.101, 0.076, 0.464, 0.139], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "A tool helps you make specialized ability checks, craft certain items, or both. A tool’s description includes the tool’s cost and weight, as well as the following entries:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.102, 0.144, 0.452, 0.176], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Ability.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " This entry lists the ability to use when making an ability check with the tool."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.102, 0.176, 0.481, 0.237], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Utilize.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " This entry lists things you can do with the tool when you take the Utilize action. You can do one of those things each time you take the action. This entry also provides the DC for the action."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.102, 0.237, 0.468, 0.313], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Craft.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " This entry lists what, if anything, you can craft with the tool. For crafting rules, see “Crafting Nonmagical Items,” “Brewing Potions of Healing,” and “Scribing Spell Scrolls” later in “Equipment.”"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.102, 0.313, 0.468, 0.36], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Variants.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " This entry appears if the tool has variants, which are listed. Each requires a separate proficiency."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.102, 0.366, 0.28, 0.386], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Tool Proficiency"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.101, 0.39, 0.484, 0.467], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "If you have proficiency with a tool, add your Proficiency Bonus to any ability check you make that uses the tool. If you have proficiency in a skill that’s used with that check, you have Advantage on the check too."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.101, 0.467, 0.478, 0.514], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Your features might give you proficiency with a tool. A monster has proficiency with any tool in its stat block."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.102, 0.521, 0.265, 0.539], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Artisan’s Tools"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.101, 0.544, 0.484, 0.592], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Artisan’s Tools are each focused on crafting items and pursuing a trade. Each of these tools requires a separate proficiency."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.102, 0.598, 0.365, 0.616], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Alchemist’s Supplies (50 GP)"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.101, 0.617, 0.466, 0.691], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Ability:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Intelligence "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Weight:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 8 lb. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Utilize:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Identify a substance (DC 15), or start a fire (DC 15) "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Craft:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Acid, Alchemist’s Fire, Component Pouch, Oil, Paper, Perfume"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.102, 0.698, 0.341, 0.716], "cont