 0.398, 0.647, 0.416], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Acid (25 GP)"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.522, 0.417, 0.893, 0.526], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "When you take the Attack action, you can replace one of your attacks with throwing a vial of Acid. Target one creature or object you can see within 20 feet of yourself. The target must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw (DC 8 plus your Dexterity modifier and Proficiency Bonus) or take 2d6 Acid damage."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.523, 0.531, 0.748, 0.549], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Alchemist’s Fire (50 GP)"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 28, "bbox": [0.522, 0.549, 0.908, 0.674], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "When you take the Attack action, you can replace one of your attacks with throwing a flask of Alchemist’s Fire. Target one creature or object you can see within 20 feet of yourself. The target must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw (DC 8 plus your Dexterity modifier and Proficiency Bonus) or take 1d4 Fire damage and start burning (see “Rules Glossary”)."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 29, "bbox": [0.523, 0.68, 0.719, 0.697], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Ammunition (Varies)"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 30, "bbox": [0.522, 0.698, 0.91, 0.807], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Ammunition is required by a weapon that has the Ammunition property. A weapon’s description specifies the type of ammunition used by the weapon. The Ammunition table lists the different types and the amount you get when you buy them. The table also lists the item that is typically used to store each type; storage must be bought separately."}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 31, "bbox": [0.033, 0.953, 0.057, 0.967], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "94"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 32, "bbox": [0.102, 0.952, 0.375, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "System R