 "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " At the start of each of its turns, the devil deals 5 (1d10) Piercing damage to any creature it is grappling or any creature grappling it."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.102, 0.768, 0.488, 0.831], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Diabolical Restoration.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " If the devil dies outside the Nine Hells, its body disappears in sulfurous smoke, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in the Nine Hells."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.101, 0.835, 0.475, 0.869], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Magic Resistance.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The devil has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.102, 0.875, 0.172, 0.892], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.101, 0.895, 0.488, 0.928], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The devil makes one Claws attack and one Tail attack, or it makes two Hurl Flame attacks."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.522, 0.05, 0.903, 0.112], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Claws.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 10 (2d6 + 3) Piercing damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 13) from both claws."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.524, 0.116, 0.894, 0.15], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Tail.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 10 ft. Hit: 14 (2d10 + 3) Slashing damage."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.522, 0.153, 0.911, 0.201], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Hurl Flame.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "tex