, "index": 0, "bbox": [0.102, 0.051, 0.156, 0.067], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Traits"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.101, 0.072, 0.475, 0.105], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Magic Resistance.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The devil has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.102, 0.111, 0.173, 0.127], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.101, 0.131, 0.488, 0.164], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The devil makes one Beard attack and one Infernal Glaive attack."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.101, 0.168, 0.481, 0.232], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Beard.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (1d8 + 3) Piercing damage, and the target has the Poisoned condition until the start of the devil’s next turn. Until this poison ends, the target can’t regain Hit Points."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.101, 0.235, 0.489, 0.407], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Infernal Glaive.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 10 ft. Hit: 8 (1d10 + 3) Slashing damage. If the target is a creature and doesn’t already have an infernal wound, it is subjected to the following effect. Constitution Saving Throw: DC 12. Failure: The target receives an infernal wound. While wounded, the target loses 5 (1d10) Hit Points at the start of each of its turns. The wound closes after 1 minute, after a spell restores Hit Points to the target, or after the target or a creature within 5 feet of it takes an action to stanch the wound, doing so by succeeding on a DC 12 Wisdom (Medicine) check."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.104, 0.413, 0.182, 0.43