eature, it has the Prone condition."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.522, 0.389, 0.891, 0.438], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Fire Breath (Recharge 5–6).", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 15, each creature in a 15-foot Cone. Failure: 31 (7d8) Fire damage. Success: Half damage."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.524, 0.444, 0.61, 0.467], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Chuul"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.525, 0.474, 0.593, 0.494], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Chuul"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.525, 0.497, 0.723, 0.514], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Large Aberration, Chaotic Evil"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 28, "bbox": [0.524, 0.519, 0.571, 0.533], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 16"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 29, "bbox": [0.699, 0.519, 0.813, 0.534], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " +0 (10)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 30, "bbox": [0.524, 0.535, 0.65, 0.549], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 76 (9d10 + 27)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 31, "bbox": [0.524, 0.55, 0.69, 0.565], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Speed", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 30 ft., Swim 30 ft."}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 32, "bbox": [0.525, 0.566, 0.91, 0.615], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 32, "bbox": [0.525, 0.566, 0.91, 0.615], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td></tr><tr><td>Str 19 +4 +4</td><td>Dex 10 +0 +0</td><td>Con16 +3 +3</td></tr><tr><td>Int 5 -3 -3</td><td>Wis 11 +0 +0</td><td>Cha 5 -3 -3</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 33, "bbox": [0.524, 0.623, 0.661, 0.639], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Skills", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Perception +4"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 34, "bbox": [0.524, 0.639, 0.722, 0.654], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Immunities", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Poison; Poisoned"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 35, "bbox": [0.523, 0.654, 0.88, 0.701], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Senses", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Darkvision 60 ft.; Passive Perception 14 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Understands Deep Speech but can’t speak "}, {"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 4 (XP 1,100; PB +2)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 36, "bbox": [0.524, 0.708, 0.578, 0.726], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Traits"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 37, "bbox": [0.524, 0.729, 0.874, 0.746], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Amphibious.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The chuul can breathe air and water."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 38, "bbox": [0.522, 0.75, 0.912, 0.799], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Sense Magic.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The chuul senses magic within 120 feet of itself. This trait otherwise works like the Detect Magic spell but isn’t itself magical."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 39, "bbox": [0.524, 0.805, 0.594, 0.822], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 40, "bbox": [0.523, 0.825, 0.896, 0.859], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The chuul makes two Pincer attacks and uses Paralyzing Tentacles."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 41, "bbox": [0.522, 0.863, 0.905, 0.926], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Pincer.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 10 ft. Hit: 9 (1d10 + 4) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 14) from one of two pincers."}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 42, "bbox": [0.028, 0.952, 0.061, 0.968], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "273"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 43, "bbox": [0.102, 0.951, 0.374, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "System Reference Document 5.2.1"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 273, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.1, 0.05, 0.492, 0.144], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Paralyzing Tentacles.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Constitution Saving Throw: DC 13, one creature Grappled by the chuul. Failure: The target has the Poisoned condition and repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically. While Poisoned, the target has the Paralyzed condition."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.103, 0.15, 0.27, 0.175], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Clay Golem"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.104, 0.18, 0.236, 0.201], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Clay Golem"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.102, 0.204, 0.287, 0.221], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Large Construct, Unaligned"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.103, 0.225, 0.149, 0.24], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 14"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.276, 0.225, 0.39, 0.24], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " +3 (13)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.103, 0.24, 0.242, 0.256], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 123 (13d10 + 52)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.102, 0.256, 0.188, 0.271], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Speed", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 30 ft."}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.103, 0.273, 0.487, 0.321], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.103, 0.273, 0.487, 0.321], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td></tr><tr><td>Str 20 +5 +5</td><td>Dex 9 -1 -1</td><td>Con18 +4 +4</td></tr><tr><td>Int 3 -4 -4</td><td>Wis 8 -1 -1</td><td>Cha 1 -5 -5</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.101, 0.33, 0.479, 0.422], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Resistances", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Bludgeoning, Piercing, Slashing "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Immunities", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Acid, Poison, Psychic; Charmed, Exhaustion, Frightened, Paralyzed, Petrified, Poisoned "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Senses", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Darkvision 60 ft.; Passive Perception 9 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Common plus one other language "}, {"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 9 (XP 5,000; PB +4)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.102, 0.429, 0.157, 0.447], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Traits"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.101, 0.45, 0.482, 0.499], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Acid Absorption.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Whenever the golem is subjected to Acid damage, it takes no damage and instead regains a number of Hit Points equal to the Acid damage dealt."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.101, 0.503, 0.485, 0.612], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Berserk.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Whenever the golem starts its turn Bloodied, roll 1d6. On a 6, the golem goes berserk. On each of its turns while berserk, the golem attacks the nearest creature it can see. If no creature is near enough to move to and attack, the golem attacks an object. Once the golem goes berserk, it continues to be berserk until it is destroyed or it is no longer Bloodied."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.101, 0.615, 0.427, 0.633], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Immutable Form.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The golem can’t shape-shift."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.101, 0.636, 0.484, 0.67], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Magic Resistance.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The golem has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.102, 0.676, 0.173, 0.692], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.101, 0.696, 0.475, 0.73], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The golem makes two Slam attacks, or it makes three Slam attacks if it used Hasten this turn."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.101, 0.733, 0.474, 0.798], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Slam.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +9, reach 5 ft. Hit: 10 (1d10 + 5) Bludgeoning damage plus 6 (1d12) Acid damage, and the target’s Hit Point maximum decreases by an amount equal to the Acid damage taken."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.102, 0.803, 0.229, 0.82], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Bonus Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.101, 0.823, 0.485, 0.857], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Hasten (Recharge 5–6).", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The golem takes the Dash and Disengage actions."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.524, 0.05, 0.64, 0.074], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Cloaker"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.524, 0.08, 0.617, 0.1], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Cloaker"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.524, 0.103, 0.752, 0.12], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Large Aberration, Chaotic Neutral"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.524, 0.125, 0.572, 0.139], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 14"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.698, 0.125, 0.812, 0.14], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " +5 (15)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.524, 0.14, 0.658, 0.155], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 91 (14d10 + 14)"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.525, 0.173, 0.91, 0.221], "content": [{"type": "table_caption", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.524, 0.155, 0.673, 0.171], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Speed 10 ft., Fly 40 ft."}]}, {"type": "table_body", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.525, 0.173, 0.91, 0.221], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td></tr><tr><td>Str 17 +3 +3</td><td>Dex 15 +2 +2</td><td>Con12 +1 +1</td></tr><tr><td>Int 13 +1 +1</td><td>Wis 14 +2 +2</td><td>Cha 7 -2 -2</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 28, "bbox": [0.524, 0.228, 0.634, 0.244], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Skills", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Stealth +5"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 29, "bbox": [0.524, 0.245, 0.68, 0.26], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Immunities", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Frightened"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 30, "bbox": [0.522, 0.26, 0.843, 0.307], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Senses", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Darkvision 120 ft.; Passive Perception 12 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Deep Speech, Undercommon "}, {"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 8 (XP 3,900; PB +3)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 31, "bbox": [0.524, 0.314, 0.579, 0.331], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Traits"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 32, "bbox": [0.522, 0.335, 0.902, 0.369], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Light Sensitivity.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " While in Bright Light, the cloaker has Disadvantage on attack rolls."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 33, "bbox": [0.524, 0.375, 0.595, 0.392], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 34, "bbox": [0.522, 0.395, 0.902, 0.428], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The cloaker makes one Attach attack and two Tail attacks."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 35, "bbox": [0.522, 0.432, 0.907, 0.555], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Attach.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 13 (3d6 + 3) Piercing damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, the cloaker attaches to it. While the cloaker is attached, the target has the Blinded condition, and the cloaker can’t make Attach attacks against other targets. In addition, the cloaker halves the damage it takes (round down), and the target takes the same amount of damage."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 36, "bbox": [0.522, 0.554, 0.912, 0.618], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "The cloaker can detach itself by spending 5 feet of movement. The target or a creature within 5 feet of it can take an action to try to detach the cloaker, doing so by succeeding on a DC 14 Strength (Athletics) check."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 37, "bbox": [0.523, 0.621, 0.887, 0.655], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Tail.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 10 ft. Hit: 8 (1d10 + 3) Slashing damage."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 38, "bbox": [0.524, 0.66, 0.651, 0.678], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Bonus Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 39, "bbox": [0.522, 0.682, 0.91, 0.76], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Moan.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 13, each creature in a 60-foot Emanation originating from the cloaker. Failure: The target has the Frightened condition until the end of the cloaker’s next turn. Success: The target is immune to this cloaker’s Moan for the next 24 hours."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 40, "bbox": [0.521, 0.764, 0.91, 0.844], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Phantasms (Recharge after a Short or Long Rest).", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The cloaker casts the Mirror Image spell, requiring no spell components and using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability. The spell ends early if the cloaker starts or ends its turn in Bright Light."}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 41, "bbox": [0.028, 0.952, 0.061, 0.968], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "274"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 42, "bbox": [0.103, 0.951, 0.375, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "System Reference Document 5.2.1"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 274, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.104, 0.05, 0.276, 0.074], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Cloud Giant"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.104, 0.08, 0.239, 0.1], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Cloud Giant"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.103, 0.104, 0.241, 0.12], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Huge Giant, Neutral"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.103, 0.125, 0.14