 "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Traits"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.101, 0.32, 0.489, 0.383], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Elemental Restoration.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " If the djinni dies outside the Elemental Plane of Air, its body dissolves into mist, and it gains a new body in 1d4 days, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere on the Plane of Air."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.101, 0.388, 0.482, 0.42], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Magic Resistance.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The djinni has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.101, 0.423, 0.49, 0.534], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Wishes.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The djinni has a 30 percent chance of knowing the Wish spell. If the djinni knows it, the djinni can cast it only on behalf of a non-genie creature who communicates a wish in a way the djinni can understand. If the djinni casts the spell for the creature, the djinni suffers none of the spell’s stress. Once the djinni has cast it three times, the djinni can’t do so again for 365 days."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.102, 0.539, 0.173, 0.556], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.101, 0.56, 0.45, 0.593], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The djinni makes three attacks, using Storm Blade or Storm Bolt in any combination."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.101, 0.597, 0.469, 0.645], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Storm Blade.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +9, reach 5 feet. Hit: 12 (2d6 + 5) Slashing damage plus 7 (2d6) Lightning damage."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.101, 0.648, 0.49, 0.696], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Storm Bolt.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Ranged Attack Roll: +9, range 120 feet. Hit: 13 (3d8) Thunder damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the Prone condition."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.101, 0.7, 0.48, 0.793], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Create Whirlwind.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The djinni conjures a whirlwind at a point it can see within 120 feet. The whirlwind fills a 20-foot-radius, 60-foot-high Cylinder centered on that point. The whirlwind lasts until the djinni’s Concentration on it ends. The djinni can move the whirlwind up to 20 feet at the start of each of its turns."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.101, 0.793, 0.479, 0.917], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whenever the whirlwind enters a creature’s space or a creature enters the whirlwind, that creature is subjected to the following effect. Strength Saving Throw: DC 17 (a creature makes this save only once per turn, and the djinni is unaffected). Failure: While in the whirlwind, the target has the Restrained condition and moves with the whirlwind. At the start of each of its turns, the Restrained target takes 21 (6d6) Thunder"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.522, 0.05, 0.902, 0.082], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "damage. At the end of each of its turns, the target repeats the save, ending the effect on itself on a success."}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.522, 0.086, 0.9, 0.135], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Spellcasting.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The djinni casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 17):"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.524, 0.154, 0.898, 0.184], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2/Day Each:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Create Food and Water (can create wine instead of water), Tongues, Wind Walk"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.525, 0.184, 0.907, 0.216], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1/Day Each:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Creation, Gaseous Form, Invisibility, Major Image, Plane Shift"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.525, 0.223, 0.723, 0.25], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Doppelganger"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.525, 0.254, 0.682, 0.276], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Doppelganger"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.524, 0.277, 0.722, 0.293], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Medium Monstrosity, Neutral"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.524, 0.298, 0.572, 0.312], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 14"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.699, 0.298, 0.813, 0.313], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " +4 (14)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 28, "bbox": [0.524, 0.314, 0.642, 0.328], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 52 (8d8 + 16)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 29, "bbox": [0.525, 0.329, 0.608, 0.344], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Speed", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 30 ft."}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 30, "bbox": [0.525, 0.345, 0.909, 0.393], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 30, "bbox": [0.525, 0.345, 0.909, 0.393], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td></tr><tr><td>Str 11 +0 +0</td><td>Dex 18 +4 +4</td><td>Con14 +2 +2</td></tr><tr><td>Int 11 +0 +0</td><td>Wis 12 +1 +1</td><td>Cha 14 +2 +2</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 31, "bbox": [0.524, 0.402, 0.73, 0.418], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Skills", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Deception +6, Insight +3"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 32, "bbox": [0.524, 0.418, 0.671, 0.433], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Immunities", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Charmed"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 33, "bbox": [0.523, 0.432, 0.839, 0.479], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Senses", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Darkvision 60 ft.; Passive Perception 11 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Common plus three other languages "}, {"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 3 (XP 700; PB +2)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 34, "bbox": [0.524, 0.487, 0.595, 0.504], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 35, "bbox": [0.522, 0.508, 0.91, 0.541], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The doppelganger makes two Slam attacks and uses Unsettling Visage if available."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 36, "bbox": [0.522, 0.545, 0.912, 0.593], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Slam.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +6 (with Advantage during the first round of each combat), reach 5 ft. Hit: 11 (2d6 + 4) Bludgeoning damage."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 37, "bbox": [0.523, 0.597, 0.9, 0.645], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Read Thoughts.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The doppelganger casts Detect Thoughts, requiring no spell components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 12)."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 38, "bbox": [0.522, 0.648, 0.912, 0.758], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Unsettling Visage (Recharge 6).", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 12, each creature in a 15-foot Emanation originating from the doppelganger that can see the doppelganger. Failure: The target has the Frightened condition and repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 39, "bbox": [0.524, 0.764, 0.651, 0.781], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Bonus Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 40, "bbox": [0.522, 0.784, 0.911, 0.864], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Shape-Shift.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The doppelganger shape-shifts into a Medium or Small Humanoid, or it returns to its true form. Its game statistics, other than its size, are the same in each form. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn’t transformed."}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 41, "bbox": [0.027, 0.952, 0.062, 0.968], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "280"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 42, "bbox": [0.102, 0.952, 0.374, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "System Reference Document 5.2.1"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 280, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.104, 0.05, 0.305, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Dragon Turtle"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.104, 0.08, 0.263, 0.101], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Dragon Turtle"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.103, 0.104, 0.295, 0.12], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Gargantuan Dragon, Neutral"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.103, 0.125, 0.15, 0.139], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 20"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.276, 0.125, 0.391, 0.14], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " +6 (16)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index"