age."}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 54, "bbox": [0.028, 0.952, 0.062, 0.968], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "282"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 55, "bbox": [0.102, 0.951, 0.374, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "System Reference Document 5.2.1"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 282, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.101, 0.049, 0.487, 0.097], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Rock Launch.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Ranged Attack Roll: +8, range 60 ft. Hit: 8 (1d6 + 5) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the Prone condition."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.104, 0.105, 0.201, 0.127], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Efreeti"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.104, 0.134, 0.181, 0.154], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Efreeti"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.102, 0.158, 0.322, 0.174], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Large Elemental (Genie), Neutral"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.102, 0.179, 0.149, 0.194], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 17"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.276, 0.179, 0.388, 0.195], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " +1 (11)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.102, 0.194, 0.248, 0.209], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 212 (17d10 + 119)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.102, 0.211, 0.302, 0.225], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Speed", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 40 ft., Fly 60 ft. (hover)"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.104, 0.227, 0.487, 0.274], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.104, 0.227, 0.487, 0.274], "content": "<table><tbody><tr