on start burning."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 39, "bbox": [0.522, 0.77, 0.908, 0.849], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Fire Form.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The elemental can move through a space as narrow as 1 inch without expending extra movement to do so, and it can enter a creature’s space and stop there. The first time it enters a creature’s space on a turn, that creature takes 5 (1d10) Fire damage."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 40, "bbox": [0.522, 0.851, 0.905, 0.885], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Illumination.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The elemental sheds Bright Light in a 30- foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 30 feet."}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 41, "bbox": [0.028, 0.952, 0.062, 0.968], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "284"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 42, "bbox": [0.102, 0.951, 0.374, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "System Reference Document 5.2.1"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 284, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.101, 0.049, 0.482, 0.098], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Water Susceptibility.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The elemental takes 3 (1d6) Cold damage for every 5 feet the elemental moves in water or for every gallon of water splashed on it."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.102, 0.104, 0.172, 0.121], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.102, 0.125, 0.466, 0.142], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The elemental makes two Burn attacks."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.101, 0.146, 0.49, 0.195], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Burn.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 10 (2d6 + 3) Fire damage. If the target is a creature or a flammable object, it starts burning."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.103, 0.202, 0.248, 0.224], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Fire Giant"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.103, 0.231, 0.218, 0.251], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Fire Giant"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.101, 0.255, 0.261, 0.322], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Huge Giant, Lawful Evil "}, {"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 18 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 162 (13d12 + 78) "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Speed", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 30 ft."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.276, 0.275, 0.39, 0.291], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " +3 (13)"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.104, 0.323, 0.488, 0.371], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.104, 0.323, 0.488, 0.371], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td></tr><tr><td>Str 25 +7 +7</td><td>Dex 9 -1 +3</td><td>Con23 +6 +10</td></tr><tr><td>Int 10 +0 +0</td><td>Wis 14 +2 +2</td><td>Cha 13 +1 +5</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.101, 0.38, 0.33, 0.458], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Skills", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Athletics +11, Perception +6 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Immunities", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Fire "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Senses", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Passive Perception 16 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Giant "}, {"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 9 (XP 5,000; PB +4)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1