16, "bbox": [0.101, 0.894, 0.43, 0.911], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The ghoul makes two Bite attacks."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.523, 0.05, 0.903, 0.082], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Bite.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d6 + 2) Piercing damage plus 3 (1d6) Necrotic damage."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.521, 0.086, 0.901, 0.18], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Claw.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 4 (1d4 + 2) Slashing damage. If the target is a creature that isn’t an Undead or elf, it is subjected to the following effect. Constitution Saving Throw: DC 10. Failure: The target has the Paralyzed condition until the end of its next turn."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.524, 0.187, 0.795, 0.211], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Gibbering Mouther"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.524, 0.217, 0.738, 0.238], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Gibbering Mouther"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.524, 0.24, 0.77, 0.256], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Medium Aberration, Chaotic Neutral"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.524, 0.262, 0.563, 0.276], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC 9"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.699, 0.262, 0.804, 0.277], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " −1 (9)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.524, 0.278, 0.689, 0.308], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 52 (7d8 + 21) "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Speed", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 20 ft., Swim 20 ft."}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.525, 0.309, 0.91, 0.357], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.525, 0.309, 0.91, 0.357], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td></tr><tr><td>Str 10 +0 +0</td><td>Dex 8 -1 -1</td><td>Con16 +3 +3</td></tr><tr><td>Int 3 -4 -4</td><td>Wis 10 +0 +0</td><td>Cha 6 -2 -2</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.524, 0.366, 0.648, 0.381], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Immunities Prone"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.523, 0.381, 0.836, 0.428], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Senses", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Darkvision 60 ft.; Passive Perception 10 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " None "}, {"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 2 (XP 450; PB +2)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 28, "bbox": [0.524, 0.436, 0.578, 0.452], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Traits"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 29, "bbox": [0.523, 0.457, 0.899, 0.489], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Aberrant Ground.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The ground in a 10-foot Emanation originating from the mouther is Difficult Terrain."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 30, "bbox": [0.522, 0.493, 0.896, 0.587], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Gibbering.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The mouther babbles incoherently while it doesn’t have the Incapacitated condition. Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 10, any creature that starts its turn within 20 feet of the mouther while it is babbling. Failure: The target rolls 1d8 to determine what it does during the current turn:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 31, "bbox": [0.524, 0.591, 0.731, 0.607], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1–4.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The target does nothing."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 32, "bbox": [0.524, 0.607, 0.904, 0.638], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "5–6.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The target takes no action or Bonus Action and uses all its movement to move in a random direction."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 33, "bbox": [0.524, 0.638, 0.896, 0.685], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "7–8.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The target makes a melee attack against a randomly determined creature within its reach or does nothing if it can’t make such an attack."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 34, "bbox": [0.524, 0.691, 0.595, 0.709], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 35, "bbox": [0.522, 0.712, 0.894, 0.806], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Bite.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +2, reach 5 ft. Hit: 7 (2d6) Piercing damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, it has the Prone condition. The target dies if it is reduced to 0 Hit Points by this attack. Its body is then absorbed into the mouther, leaving only equipment behind."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 36, "bbox": [0.522, 0.81, 0.911, 0.889], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Blinding Spittle (Recharge 5–6).", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 10, each creature in a 10-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point within 30 feet. Failure: 7 (2d6) Radiant damage, and the target has the Blinded condition until the end of the mouther’s next turn."}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 37, "bbox": [0.027, 0.952, 0.062, 0.967], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "288"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 38, "bbox": [0.103, 0.952, 0.374, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "System Reference Document 5.2.1"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 288, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.103, 0.0