 "text", "content": " Truesight 120 ft.; Passive Perception 17 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Abyssal; telepathy 120 ft. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 9 (XP 5,000; PB +4)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.103, 0.329, 0.156, 0.346], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Traits"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.101, 0.351, 0.48, 0.413], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Demonic Restoration.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " If the glabrezu dies outside the Abyss, its body dissolves into ichor, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in the Abyss."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.101, 0.417, 0.484, 0.451], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Magic Resistance.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The glabrezu has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.102, 0.457, 0.172, 0.474], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.101, 0.477, 0.464, 0.511], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The glabrezu makes two Pincer attacks and uses Pummel or Spellcasting."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.101, 0.514, 0.488, 0.577], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Pincer.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +9, reach 10 ft. Hit: 16 (2d10 + 5) Slashing damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 15) from one of two pincers."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.101, 0.581, 0.48, 0.63], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Pummel.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 17, one creature Grappled by the glabrezu. Failure: 15 (3d6 + 5) Bludgeoning damage. Success: Half damage."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.101, 0.633, 0.481, 0.682], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Spellcasting.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The glabrezu casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Intelligence as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 16):"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.102, 0.684, 0.429, 0.718], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "At Will:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Darkness, Detect Magic, Dispel Magic "}, {"type": "text", "content": "1/Day Each:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Confusion, Fly, Power Word Stun"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.104, 0.725, 0.239, 0.748], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Gladiator"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.104, 0.755, 0.21, 0.774], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Gladiator"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.102, 0.777, 0.352, 0.794], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Medium or Small Humanoid, Neutral"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.102, 0.799, 0.236, 0.847], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 16 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 112 (15d8 + 45) "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Speed", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 30 ft."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.276, 0.799, 0.39, 0.815], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " +5 (15)"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.526, 0.05, 0.909, 0.098], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.526, 0.05, 0.909, 0.098], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD