": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.102, 0.884, 0.416, 0.916], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The incubus makes two Restless Touch attacks."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.522, 0.05, 0.901, 0.127], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Restless Touch.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 15 (3d6 + 5) Psychic damage, and the target is cursed for 24 hours or until the incubus dies. Until the curse ends, the target gains no benefit from finishing Short Rests."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.522, 0.132, 0.899, 0.181], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Spellcasting.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The incubus casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 15):"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.524, 0.183, 0.767, 0.2], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "At Will:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Disguise Self, Etherealness"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.524, 0.2, 0.79, 0.216], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1/Day Each:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Dream, Hypnotic Pattern"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.524, 0.223, 0.65, 0.24], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Bonus Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.522, 0.244, 0.898, 0.354], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Nightmare (Recharge 6).", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 15, one creature the incubus can see within 60 feet. Failure: If the target has 20 Hit Points or fewer, it has the Unconscious condition for 1 hour, until it takes damage, or until a creature within 5 feet of it takes an action to wake it. Oth