 "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Paralyzing Touch.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +12, reach 5 ft. Hit: 15 (3d6 + 5) Cold damage, and the target has the Paralyzed condition until the start of the lich’s next turn."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 37, "bbox": [0.523, 0.28, 0.902, 0.327], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Spellcasting.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The lich casts one of the following spells, using Intelligence as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 20):"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 38, "bbox": [0.524, 0.332, 0.902, 0.378], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "At Will:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Detect Magic, Detect Thoughts, Dispel Magic, Fireball (level 5 version), Invisibility, Lightning Bolt (level 5 version), Mage Hand, Prestidigitation"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 39, "bbox": [0.525, 0.379, 0.844, 0.408], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2/Day Each:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Animate Dead, Dimension Door, Plane Shift"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 40, "bbox": [0.525, 0.409, 0.892, 0.441], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1/Day Each:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Chain Lightning, Finger of Death, Power Word Kill, Scrying"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 41, "bbox": [0.525, 0.447, 0.61, 0.464], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Reactions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 42, "bbox": [0.523, 0.468, 0.905, 0.517], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Protective Magic.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The lich casts Counterspell or Shield in response to the spell’s trigger, using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 43, "bbox": [0.524, 0.523, 0.684, 0.541], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Legendary Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 44, "bbox": [0.522, 0.542, 0.908, 0.594], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Legendary Action Uses: 3 (4 in Lair). Immediately after another creature’s turn, the lich can expend a use to take one of the following actions. The lich regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 45, "bbox": [0.523, 0.599, 0.887, 0.662], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Deathly Teleport.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The lich teleports up to 60 feet to an unoccupied space it can see, and each creature within 10 feet of the space it left takes 11 (2d10) Necrotic damage."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 46, "bbox": [0.522, 0.665, 0.902, 0.76], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Disrupt Life.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Constitution Saving Throw: DC 20, each creature that isn’t an Undead in a 20-foot Emanation originating from the lich. Failure: 31 (9d6) Necrotic damage. Success: Half damage. Failure or Success: The lich can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 47, "bbox": [0.522, 0.763, 0.895, 0.812], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Frightening Gaze.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The lich casts Fear, using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting. The lich can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn."}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 48, "bbox": [0.028, 0.952, 0.062, 0.968], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "304"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 49, "bbox": [0.103, 0.951, 0.373, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "System Reference Document 5.2.1"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 304, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.104, 0.051, 0.193, 0.075], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Mages"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.104, 0.08, 0.165, 0.102], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Mage"}], "level": 2}, {"type": 