mmy"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.524, 0.103, 0.776, 0.12], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Medium or Small Undead, Lawful Evil"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.524, 0.125, 0.568, 0.139], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 11"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.698, 0.125, 0.804, 0.14], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " −1 (9)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.524, 0.14, 0.642, 0.155], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 58 (9d8 + 18)"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.525, 0.173, 0.91, 0.221], "content": [{"type": "table_caption", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.525, 0.156, 0.608, 0.171], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Speed 20 ft."}]}, {"type": "table_body", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.525, 0.173, 0.91, 0.221], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td></tr><tr><td>Str 16 +3 +3</td><td>Dex 8 -1 -1</td><td>Con15 +2 +2</td></tr><tr><td>Int 6 -2 -2</td><td>Wis 12 +1 +3</td><td>Cha 12 +1 +1</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.524, 0.229, 0.656, 0.244], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Vulnerabilities", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Fire"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.523, 0.244, 0.867, 0.322], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Immunities", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Necrotic, Poison; Charmed, Exhaustion, Frightened, Paralyzed, Poisoned "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Senses", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Darkvision 60 ft.; Passive Perception 11 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Common plus two other languages "}, {"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 3 (XP 700; PB +2)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.524, 0.33, 0.595, 0.347], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 28, "bbox": [0.522, 0.35, 0.885, 0.383], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The mummy makes two Rotting Fist attacks and uses Dreadful Glare."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 29, "bbox": [0.522, 0.387, 0.904, 0.512], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Rotting Fist.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 8 (1d10 + 3) Bludgeoning damage plus 10 (3d6) Necrotic damage. If the target is a creature, it is cursed. While cursed, the target can’t regain Hit Points, its Hit Point maximum doesn’t return to normal when finishing a Long Rest, and its Hit Point maximum decreases by 10 (3d6) every 24 hours that elapse. A creature dies and turns to dust if reduced to 0 Hit Points by this attack."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 30, "bbox": [0.522, 0.515, 0.908, 0.594], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Dreadful Glare.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 11, one creature the mummy can see within 60 feet. Failure: The target has the Frightened condition until the end of the mummy’s next turn. Success: The target is immune to this mummy’s Dreadful Glare for 24 hours."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 31, "bbox": [0.524, 0.602, 0.675, 0.623], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Mummy Lord"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 32, "bbox": [0.524, 0.625, 0.827, 0.642], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Medium or Small Undead (Cleric), Lawful Evil"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 33, "bbox": [0.699, 0.646, 0.821, 0.663], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " +10 (20)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 34, "bbox": [0.525, 0.662, 0.658, 0.678], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 187 (25d8 + 75)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 35, "bbox": [0.525, 0.678, 0.608, 0.693], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Speed", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 30 ft."}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 36, "bbox": [0.525, 0.694, 0.91, 0.743], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 36, "bbox": [0.525, 0.694, 0.91, 0.743], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td></tr><tr><td>Str 18 +4 +4</td><td>Dex 10 +0 +0</td><td>Con17 +3 +3</td></tr><tr><td>Int 11 +0 +5</td><td>Wis 19 +4 +9</td><td>Cha 16 +3 +3</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 37, "bbox": [0.524, 0.75, 0.819, 0.782], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Skills", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " History +5, Perception +9, Religion +5 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Vulnerabilities", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Fire"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 38, "bbox": [0.523, 0.781, 0.868, 0.86], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Immunities", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Necrotic, Poison; Charmed, Exhaustion, Frightened, Paralyzed, Poisoned "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Senses", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Truesight 60 ft.; Passive Perception 19 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Common plus three other languages "}, {"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 15 (XP 13,000, or 15,000 in lair; PB +5)"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 39, "bbox": [0.028, 0.952, 0.062, 0.968], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "309"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 40, "bbox": [0.103, 0.951, 0.374, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "System Reference Document 5.2.1"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 309, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.102, 0.05, 0.157, 0.067], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Traits"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.101, 0.072, 0.476, 0.119], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Legendary Resistance (3/Day, or 4/Day in Lair).", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " If the mummy fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.101, 0.124, 0.482, 0.157], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Magic Resistance.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The mummy has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.101, 0.16, 0.488, 0.254], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Undead Restoration.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " If destroyed, the mummy gains a new body in 24 hours if its heart is intact, reviving with all its Hit Points. The new body appears in an unoccupied space within the mummy’s lair. The heart is a Tiny object that has AC 17, HP 10, and Immunity to all damage except Fire."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.101, 0.26, 0.173, 0.277], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.101, 0.281, 0.443, 0.328], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The mummy makes one Rotting Fist or Channel Negative Energy attack, and it uses Dreadful Glare."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.101, 0.333, 0.487, 0.457], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Rotting Fist.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +9, reach 5 ft. Hit: 15 (2d10 + 4) Bludgeoning damage plus 10 (3d6) Necrotic damage. If the target is a creature, it is cursed. While cursed, the target can’t regain Hit Points, it gains no benefit from finishing a Long Rest, and its Hit Point maximum decreases by 10 (3d6) every 24 hours that elapse. A creature dies and turns to dust if reduced to 0 Hit Points by this attack."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.101, 0.461, 0.455, 0.494], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Channel Negative Energy.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Ranged Attack Roll: +9, range 60 ft. Hit: 25 (6d6 + 4) Necrotic damage."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.101, 0.497, 0.488, 0.561], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Dreadful Glare.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 17, one creature the mummy can see within 60 feet. Failure: 25 (6d6 + 4) Psychic damage, and the target has the Paralyzed condition until the end of the mummy’s next turn."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.101, 0.565, 0.489, 0.628], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Spellcasting.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The mummy casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 17, +9 to hit with spell attacks):"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.102, 0.631, 0.356, 0.648], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "At Will:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Dispel Magic, Thaumaturgy"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.102, 0.648, 0.482, 0.679], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1/Day Each:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Animate Dead, Harm, Insect Plague (level 7 version)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.103, 0.686, 0.19, 0.703], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Reactions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.1, 0.707, 0.478, 0.833], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whirlwind of Sand.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Trigger: The mummy is hit by an attack roll. Response: The mummy adds 2 to its AC against the attack, possibly causing the attack to miss, and the mummy teleports up to 60 feet to an unoccupied space it can see. Each creature of its choice that it can see within 5 feet of its destination space has the Blinded condition until the end of the mummy’s next turn."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.524, 0.051, 0.684, 0.069], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Legendary Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.522, 0.07, 0.902, 0.122], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Legendary Action Uses: 3 (4 in Lair). Immediately after another creature’s turn, the mummy can expend a use to take one of the following actions. The mummy regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.522, 0.126, 0.901, 0.189], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Dread Command.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The mummy casts Command (level 2 version), using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting. The mummy can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.522, 0.193, 0.901, 0.24], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Glare.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The mummy uses Dreadful Glare. The mummy can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.522, 0.245, 0.908, 0.278], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Necrotic Strike.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The mummy makes one Rotting Fist or Channel Negative Energy attack."}]}, {"type": "doc_title", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.524, 0.284, 0.684, 0.308], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Nalfeshnee"}], "level": 1}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.524, 0.314, 0.651, 0.334], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Nalfeshnee"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.524, 0.337, 0.755, 0.354], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Large Fiend (Demon), Chaotic Evil"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.524, 0.359, 0.673, 0.406], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 18 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 184 (16d10 + 96) "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Speed", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 20 ft., Fly 30 ft."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.698, 0.359, 0.812, 0.375], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " +5 (15)"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.524, 0.406, 0.91, 0.455], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.524, 0.406, 0.91, 0.455], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td></tr><tr><td>Str 21 +5 +5</td><td>Dex 10 +0 +0</td><td>Con22 +6 +11</td></tr><tr><td>Int 19 +4 +9</td><td>Wis 12 +1 +6</td><td>Cha 15 +2 +7</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.522, 0.463, 0.83, 0.541], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Resistances", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Cold, Fire, Lightning "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Immunities", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Poison; Frightened, Poisoned "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Senses", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Truesight 120 ft.; Passive Perception 11 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Abyssal; telepathy 120 ft. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 13 (XP 10,000; PB +5)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.524, 0.548, 0.579, 0.566], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Traits"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.522, 0.569, 0.911, 0.632], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Demonic Restoration.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " If the nalfeshnee dies outside the Abyss, its body dissolves into ichor, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in the Abyss."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 28, "bbox": [0.522, 0.637, 0.898, 0.67], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Magic Resistance.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The nalfeshnee has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 29, "bbox": [0.524, 0.676, 0.595, 0.692], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 30, "bbox": [0.522, 0.696, 0.906, 0.714], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The nalfeshnee makes three Rend attacks."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 31, "bbox": [0.522, 0.718, 0.911, 0.751], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Rend.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +10, reach 10 ft. Hit: 16 (2d10 + 5) Slashing damage plus 11 (2d10) Force damage."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 32, "bbox": [0.522, 0.754, 0.904, 0.787], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Teleport.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The nalfeshnee teleports up to 120 feet to an unoccupied space it can see."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 33, "bbox": [0.524, 0.793, 0.652, 0.81], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Bonus Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 34, "bbox": [0.522, 0.815, 0.909, 0.909], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Horror Nimbus (Recharge 5–6).", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 15, each creature in a 15-foot Emanation originating from the nalfeshnee. Failure: 28 (8d6) Psychic damage, and the target has the Frightened condition for 1 minute, until it takes damage, or until it ends its turn with the nalfeshnee out of line of sight. Success:"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 35, "bbox": [0.029, 0.952, 0.061, 0.968], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "310"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 36, "bbox": [0.102, 0.952, 0.375, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "System Reference Document 5.2.1"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 310, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.1, 0.05, 0.476, 0.082], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "The target is immune to this nalfeshnee’s Horror Nimbus for 24 hours."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.102, 0.089, 0.19, 0.106], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Reactions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.101, 0.109, 0.47, 0.189], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Pursuit.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Trigger: Another creature the nalfeshnee can see ends its move within 120 feet of the nalfeshnee. Response: The nalfeshnee uses Teleport, but its destination space must be within 10 feet of the triggering creature."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.103, 0.195, 0.25, 0.221], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Night Hag"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.103, 0.225, 0.22, 0.247], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Night Hag"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.102, 0.249, 0.287, 0.265], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Medium Fiend, Neutral Evil"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.102, 0.27, 0.235, 0.316], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 17 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 112 (15d8 + 45) "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Speed", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 30 ft."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.276, 0.27, 0.39, 0.286], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " +5 (15)"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.104, 0.318, 0.487, 0.365], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.104, 0.318, 0.487, 0.365], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td></tr><tr><td>Str 18 +4 +4</td><td>Dex 15 +2 +2</td><td>Con16 +3 +3</td></tr><tr><td>Int 16 +3 +3</td><td>Wis 14 +2 +2</td><td>Cha 16 +3 +3</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.101, 0.373, 0.475, 0.405], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Skills", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Deception +6, Insight +5, Perception +5, Stealth +5 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Resistances", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Cold, Fire"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.102, 0.405, 0.25, 0.42], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Immunities", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Charmed"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.101, 0.42, 0.435, 0.467], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Senses", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Darkvision 120 ft.; Passive Perception 15 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Abyssal, Common, Infernal, Primordial "}, {"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 5 (XP 1,800; PB +3)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.102, 0.474, 0.156, 0.491], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Traits"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.1, 0.495, 0.489, 0.62], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Coven Magic.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " While within 30 feet of at least two hag allies, the hag can cast one of the following spells, requiring no Material components, using the spell’s normal casting time, and using Intelligence as the spell casting ability (spell save DC 14): Augury, Find Familiar, Identify, Locate Object, Scrying, or Unseen Servant. The hag must finish a Long Rest before using this trait to cast that spell again."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.101, 0.624, 0.467, 0.657], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Magic Resistance.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The hag has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.101, 0.66, 0.485, 0.707], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Soul Bag.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The hag has a soul bag. While holding or carrying the bag, the hag can use its Nightmare Haunting action."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.101, 0.706, 0.489, 0.771], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "The bag has AC 15, HP 20, and Resistance to all damage. The bag turns to dust if reduced to 0 Hit Points. If the bag is destroyed, any souls the bag is holding are released. The hag can create a new bag after 7 days."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.102, 0.777, 0.173, 0.793], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.101, 0.796, 0.425, 0.815], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The hag makes two Claw attacks."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.101, 0.818, 0.463, 0.851], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Claw.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 13 (2d8 + 4) Slashing damage."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.1, 0.855, 0.482, 0.919], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Nightmare Haunting (1/Day; Requires Soul Bag).", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " While on the Ethereal Plane, the hag casts Dream, using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting. Only the hag can serve as the spell’s messenger, and the tar-"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.521, 0.05, 0.907, 0.112], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "get must be a creature the hag can see on the Material Plane. The spell fails and is wasted if the target is under the effect of the Protection from Evil and Good spell or within a Magic Circle spell."}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.521, 0.111, 0.91, 0.189], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "If the target takes damage from the Dream spell, the target’s Hit Point maximum decreases by an amount equal to that damage. If the spell kills the target, its soul is trapped in the hag’s soul bag, and the target can’t be raised from the dead until its soul is released."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.522, 0.193, 0.902, 0.242], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Spellcasting.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The hag casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Intelligence as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 14):"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.524, 0.245, 0.874, 0.275], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "At Will:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Detect Magic, Etherealness, Magic Missile (level 4 version)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.524, 0.275, 0.885, 0.293], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "2/Day Each:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Phantasmal Killer, Plane Shift (self only)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.524, 0.299, 0.651, 0.317], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Bonus Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.521, 0.32, 0.896, 0.399], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Shape-Shift.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The hag shape-shifts into a Small or Medium Humanoid, or it returns to its true form. Other than its size, its game statistics are the same in each form. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn’t transformed."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 28, "bbox": [0.525, 0.407, 0.679, 0.432], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Nightmare"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 29, "bbox": [0.525, 0.436, 0.647, 0.457], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Nightmare"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 30, "bbox": [0.524, 0.459, 0.688, 0.476], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Large Fiend, Neutral Evil"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 31, "bbox": [0.524, 0.48, 0.57, 0.495], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 13"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 32, "bbox": [0.699, 0.48, 0.812, 0.496], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " +2 (12)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 33, "bbox": [0.524, 0.496, 0.65, 0.511], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 68 (8d10 + 24)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 34, "bbox": [0.524, 0.512, 0.724, 0.526], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Speed", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 60 ft., Fly 90 ft. (hover)"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 35, "bbox": [0.525, 0.527, 0.909, 0.574], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 35, "bbox": [0.525, 0.527, 0.909, 0.574], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td></tr><tr><td>Str 18 +4 +4</td><td>Dex 15 +2 +2</td><td>Con16 +3 +3</td></tr><tr><td>Int 10 +0 +0</td><td>Wis 13 +1 +1</td><td>Cha 15 +2 +2</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 36, "bbox": [0.524, 0.594, 0.718, 0.609], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Senses", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Passive Perception 11"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 37, "bbox": [0.524, 0.609, 0.894, 0.64], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Understands Abyssal, Common, and Infernal but can’t speak"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 38, "bbox": [0.524, 0.64, 0.669, 0.656], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 3 (XP 700; PB +2)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 39, "bbox": [0.524, 0.663, 0.578, 0.681], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Traits"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 40, "bbox": [0.522, 0.684, 0.891, 0.732], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Confer Fire Resistance.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The nightmare can grant Resistance to Fire damage to a rider while it is on the nightmare."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 41, "bbox": [0.522, 0.736, 0.905, 0.77], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Illumination.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The nightmare sheds Bright Light in a 10- foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 10 feet."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 42, "bbox": [0.524, 0.776, 0.595, 0.792], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 43, "bbox": [0.522, 0.796, 0.906, 0.83], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Hooves.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 13 (2d8 + 4) Bludgeoning damage plus 10 (3d6) Fire damage."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 44, "bbox": [0.522, 0.833, 0.901, 0.881], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Ethereal Stride.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The nightmare and up to three willing creatures within 5 feet of it teleport to the Ethereal Plane from the Material Plane or vice versa."}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 45, "bbox": [0.03, 0.952, 0.059, 0.968], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "311"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 46, "bbox": [0.102, 0.951, 0.375, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "System Reference Document 5.2.1"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 311, "blocks": [{"type": "p