ng to make an ability check."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.102, 0.857, 0.172, 0.874], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.101, 0.878, 0.475, 0.911], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Pseudopod.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 12 (3d6 + 2) Acid damage."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.525, 0.05, 0.61, 0.068], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Reactions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 28, "bbox": [0.522, 0.071, 0.908, 0.182], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Split.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Trigger: While the jelly is Large or Medium and has 10+ Hit Points, it becomes Bloodied or is subjected to Lightning or Slashing damage. Response: The jelly splits into two new "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ochre Jellies", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": ". Each new jelly is one size smaller than the original jelly and acts on its Initiative. The original jelly’s Hit Points are divided evenly between the new jellies (round down)."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 29, "bbox": [0.525, 0.189, 0.6, 0.213], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Ogre"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 30, "bbox": [0.525, 0.218, 0.585, 0.239], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Ogre"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 31, "bbox": [0.525, 0.241, 0.689, 0.257], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Large Giant, Chaotic Evil"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 32, "bbox": [0.525, 0.262, 0.568, 0.277], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 11"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 33, "bbox": [0.699, 0.263, 0.804, 0.278], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " −1 (9)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index"