tent": "Skills", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Perception +5, Stealth +4 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Senses", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Blindsight 10 ft., Darkvision 60 ft.; Passive Perception 15"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 42, "bbox": [0.525, 0.441, 0.904, 0.471], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Understands Common and Draconic but can’t speak"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 43, "bbox": [0.525, 0.472, 0.671, 0.488], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 1/4 (XP 50; PB +2)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 44, "bbox": [0.525, 0.496, 0.578, 0.513], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Traits"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 45, "bbox": [0.523, 0.516, 0.885, 0.564], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Magic Resistance.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The pseudodragon has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 46, "bbox": [0.524, 0.571, 0.594, 0.589], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 47, "bbox": [0.523, 0.592, 0.902, 0.61], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The pseudodragon makes two Bite attacks."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 48, "bbox": [0.523, 0.613, 0.903, 0.646], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Bite.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 4 (1d4 + 2) Piercing damage."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 49, "bbox": [0.522, 0.65, 0.91, 0.759], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Sting.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Constitution Saving Throw: DC 12, one creature the pseudodragon can see within 5 feet. Failure: 5 (2d4) Poison damage, and the target has the Poisoned condition for 1 hour. Failure by 5 or More: While Poisoned, the target also has the Unconscious condition, which ends early if the target takes damage or a creature within 5 feet of it takes an action to wake it."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 50, "bbox": [0.525, 0.766, 0.718, 0.79], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Purple Worm"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 51, "bbox": [0.525, 0.796, 0.678, 0.817], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Purple Worm"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 52, "bbox": [0.524, 0.82, 0.762, 0.836], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Gargantuan Monstrosity, Unaligned"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 53, "bbox": [0.524, 0.84, 0.572, 0.856], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 18"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 54, "bbox": [0.698, 0.84, 0.812, 0.857], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " +3 (13)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 55, "bbox": [0.524, 0.856, 0.667, 0.871], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 247 (15d20 + 90)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 56, "bbox": [0.524, 0.871, 0.703, 0.888], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Speed", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 50 ft., Burrow 50 ft."}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 57, "bbox": [0.029, 0.952, 0.061, 0.968], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "316"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 58, "bbox": [0.103, 0.951, 0.374, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "System Reference Document 5.2.1"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 316, "blocks": [{"type": "table", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.104, 0.05, 0.487, 0.098], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.104, 0.05, 0.487, 0.098], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td></tr><tr><td>Str 28 +9 +9</td><td>Dex 7 -2 -2</td><td>Con22 +6 +11</td></tr><tr><td>Int 1 -5 -5</td><td>Wis 8 -1 +4</td><td>Cha 4 -3 -3</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.101, 0.107, 0.392, 0.169], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Senses", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Blindsight 30 ft., Tremorsense 60 ft.; Passive Perception 9 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " None "}, {"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 15 (XP 13,000; PB +5)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.103, 0.177, 0.156, 0.194], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Traits"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.101, 0.197, 0.478, 0.246], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Tunneler.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The worm can burrow through solid rock at half its Burrow Speed and leaves a 10-foot-diameter tunnel in its wake."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.102, 0.253, 0.172, 0.269], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.101, 0.273, 0.482, 0.306], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The worm makes one Bite attack and one Tail Stinger attack."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.101, 0.31, 0.483, 0.389], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Bite.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +14, reach 10 ft. Hit: 22 (3d8 + 9) Piercing damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 19), and it has the Restrained condition until the grapple ends."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.102, 0.392, 0.467, 0.44], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Tail Stinger.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +14, reach 10 ft. Hit: 16 (2d6 + 9) Piercing damage plus 35 (10d6) Poison damage."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.102, 0.447, 0.228, 0.463], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Bonus Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.101, 0.467, 0.487, 0.591], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Swallow.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Strength Saving Throw: DC 19, one Large or smaller creature Grappled by the worm (it can have up to three creatures swallowed at a time). Failure: The target is swallowed by the worm, and the Grappled condition ends. A swallowed creature has the Blinded and Restrained conditions, has Total Cover against attacks and other effects outside the worm, and takes 17 (5d6) Acid damage at the start of each of the worm’s turns."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.101, 0.591, 0.487, 0.731], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "If the worm takes 30 damage or more on a single turn from a creature inside it, the worm must succeed on a DC 21 Constitution saving throw at the end of that turn or regurgitate all swallowed creatures, each of which falls in a space within 5 feet of the worm and has the Prone condition. If the worm dies, any swallowed creature no longer has the Restrained condition and can escape from the corpse using 20 feet of movement, exiting Prone."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.104, 0.738, 0.201, 0.761], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Quasit"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.104, 0.767, 0.181, 0.788], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Quasit"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.103, 0.79, 0.324, 0.806], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Tiny Fiend (Demon), Chaotic Evil"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.102, 0.811, 0.195, 0.859], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 13 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 25 (10d4) "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Speed", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 40 ft."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.277, 0.812, 0.39, 0.828], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " +3 (13)"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.525, 0.05, 0.91, 0.098], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.525, 0.05, 0.91, 0.098], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td></tr><tr><td>Str 5 -3 -3</td><td>Dex 17 +3 +3</td><td>Con10 +0 +0</td></tr><tr><td>Int 7 -2 -2</td><td>Wis 10 +0 +0</td><td>Cha10 +0 +0</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.524, 0.107, 0.633, 0.121], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Skills", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Stealth +5"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.523, 0.121, 0.844, 0.199], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Resistances", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Cold, Fire, Lightning "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Immunities", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Poison; Poisoned "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Senses", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Darkvision 120 ft.; Passive Perception 10 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Abyssal, Common "}, {"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 1 (XP 200; PB +2)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.524, 0.207, 0.578, 0.224], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Traits"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.522, 0.229, 0.904, 0.262], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Magic Resistance.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The quasit has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.524, 0.268, 0.594, 0.285], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.522, 0.288, 0.909, 0.336], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Rend.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +5, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d4 + 3) Slashing damage, and the target has the Poisoned condition until the start of the quasit’s next turn."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.522, 0.34, 0.904, 0.389], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Invisibility.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The quasit casts Invisibility on itself, requiring no spell components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.522, 0.393, 0.912, 0.471], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Scare (1/Day).", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 10, one creature within 20 feet. Failure: The target has the Frightened condition. At the end of each of its turns, the target repeats the save, ending the effect on itself on a success. After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.522, 0.474, 0.907, 0.57], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Shape-Shift.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The quasit shape-shifts to resemble a bat (Speed 10 ft., Fly 40 ft.), a centipede (40 ft., Climb 40 ft.), or a toad (40 ft., Swim 40 ft.), or it returns to its true form. Its game statistics are the same in each form, except for its Speed. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn’t transformed."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.525, 0.576, 0.656, 0.599], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Rakshasa"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.525, 0.606, 0.628, 0.626], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Rakshasa"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text