0.171, 0.684, 0.189], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Legendary Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.522, 0.19, 0.895, 0.243], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Legendary Action Uses: 3 (4 in Lair). Immediately after another creature’s turn, the dragon can expend a use to take one of the following actions. The dragon regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.522, 0.247, 0.899, 0.294], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Commanding Presence.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The dragon uses Spellcasting to cast Command (level 2 version). The dragon can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.522, 0.298, 0.912, 0.346], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Fiery Rays.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The dragon uses Spellcasting to cast Scorching Ray (level 3 version). The dragon can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.522, 0.35, 0.902, 0.382], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Pounce.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The dragon moves up to half its Speed, and it makes one Rend attack."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.525, 0.39, 0.672, 0.412], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Remorhaz"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.524, 0.42, 0.642, 0.44], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Remorhaz"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 28, "bbox": [0.524, 0.443, 0.721, 0.46], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Huge Monstrosity, Unaligned"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 29, "bbox": [0.524, 0.464, 0.704, 0.51], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 17 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 195 (17d12 + 85) "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Speed", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 40 ft., Burrow 30 ft."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 30, "bbox": [0.698, 0.464, 0.812, 0.48], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " +5 (15)"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 31, "bbox": [0.525, 0.512, 0.91, 0.56], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 31, "bbox": [0.525, 0.512, 0.91, 0.56], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td></tr><tr><td>Str 24 +7 +7</td><td>Dex 13 +1 +1</td><td>Con21 +5 +5</td></tr><tr><td>Int 4 -3 -3</td><td>Wis 10 +0 +0</td><td>Cha 5 -3 -3</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 32, "bbox": [0.523, 0.571, 0.821, 0.646], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Immunities", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Cold, Fire "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Senses", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Darkvision 60 ft., Tremorsense 60 ft.; Passive Perception 10 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " None "}, {"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 11 (XP 7,200; PB +4)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 33, "bbox": [0.524, 0.653, 0.578, 0.671], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Traits"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 34, "bbox": [0.522, 0.674, 0.902, 0.723], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Heat Aura.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " At the end of each of the remorhaz’s turns, each creature in a 5-foot Emanation originating from the remorhaz takes 16 (3d10) Fire damage."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 35, "bbox": [0.524, 0.729, 0.595, 0.746], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 36, "bbox": [0.522, 0.749, 0.909, 0.829], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Bite.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +11, reach 10 ft. Hit: 18 (2d10 + 7) Piercing damage plus 14 (4d6) Fire damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the Grappled condition (escape DC 17), and it has the Restrained condition until the grapple ends."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 37, "bbox": [0.524, 0.835, 0.65, 0.852], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Bonus Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 38, "bbox": [0.522, 0.856, 0.909, 0.935], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Swallow.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Strength Saving Throw: DC 19, one Large or smaller creature Grappled by the remorhaz (it can have up to two creatures swallowed at a time). Failure: The target is swallowed by the remorhaz, and the Grappled condition ends. A swallowed creature has the Blinded"}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 39, "bbox": [0.029, 0.952, 0.061, 0.968], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "319"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 40, "bbox": [0.102, 0.951, 0.374, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "System Reference Document 5.2.1"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 319, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.101, 0.05, 0.478, 0.112], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "and Restrained conditions, it has Total Cover against attacks and other effects outside the remorhaz, and it takes 10 (3d6) Acid damage plus 10 (3d6) Fire damage at the start of each of the remorhaz’s turns."}], "continues_prev": true}, {"type": "text", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.101, 0.112, 0.489, 0.251], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "If the remorhaz takes 30 damage or more on a single turn from a creature inside it, the remorhaz must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw at the end of that turn or regurgitate all swallowed creatures, each of which falls in a space within 5 feet of the remorhaz and has the Prone condition. If the remorhaz dies, any swallowed creature no longer has the Restrained condition and can escape from the corpse by using 15 feet of movement, exiting Prone."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.104, 0.258, 0.16, 0.28], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Roc"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.104, 0.288, 0.15, 0.308], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Roc"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.103, 0.311, 0.34, 0.328], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Gargantuan Monstrosity, Unaligned"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.102, 0.333, 0.259, 0.379], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 15 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 248 (16d20 + 80) "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Speed", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 20 ft., Fly 120 ft."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.277, 0.332, 0.391, 0.348], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " +8 (18)"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.104, 0.381, 0.487, 0.428], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.104, 0.381, 0.487, 0.428], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td></tr><tr><td>Str 28 +9 +9</td><td>Dex 10 +0 +4</td><td>Con20 +5 +5</td></tr><tr><td>Int 3 -4 -4</td><td>Wis 10 +0 +4</td><td>Cha 9 -1 -1</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.102, 0.437, 0.298, 0.499], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Skills", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Perception +8 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Senses", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Passive Perception 18 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " None "}, {"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "cont