 " The roper can climb difficult surfaces, including along ceilings, without needing to make an ability check."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.524, 0.252, 0.594, 0.269], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.523, 0.273, 0.881, 0.305], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The roper makes two Tentacle attacks, uses Reel, and makes two Bite attacks."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 28, "bbox": [0.524, 0.309, 0.908, 0.343], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Bite.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 5 ft. Hit: 17 (3d8 + 4) Piercing damage."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 29, "bbox": [0.523, 0.346, 0.907, 0.408], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Tentacle.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 60 ft. Hit: The target has the Grappled condition (escape DC 14) from one of six tentacles, and the target has the Poisoned condition until the grapple ends."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 30, "bbox": [0.522, 0.408, 0.911, 0.486], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "The tentacle can be damaged, freeing a creature it has Grappled when destroyed (AC 20, HP 10, Immunity to Poison and Psychic damage). Damaging the tentacle deals no damage to the roper, and a destroyed tentacle regrows at the start of the roper’s next turn."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 31, "bbox": [0.522, 0.489, 0.896, 0.523], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Reel.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The roper pulls each creature Grappled by it up to 30 feet straight toward it."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 32, "bbox": [0.525, 0.53, 0.716, 0.553], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Rust Monster"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 33, "bbox": [0.525, 0.56, 0.676, 0.58], "content": [{"type": "tex