styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The rust monster can pinpoint the location of ferrous metal within 30 feet of itself."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 43, "bbox": [0.524, 0.823, 0.594, 0.84], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 44, "bbox": [0.523, 0.844, 0.888, 0.876], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The rust monster makes one Bite attack and uses Antennae twice."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 45, "bbox": [0.523, 0.88, 0.901, 0.914], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Bite.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +3, reach 5 ft. Hit: 5 (1d8 + 1) Piercing damage."}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 46, "bbox": [0.028, 0.952, 0.062, 0.968], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "320"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 47, "bbox": [0.103, 0.951, 0.374, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "System Reference Document 5.2.1"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 320, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.101, 0.05, 0.484, 0.205], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Antennae.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The rust monster targets one nonmagical metal object—armor or a weapon—worn or carried by a creature within 5 feet of itself. Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 11, the creature with the object. Failure: The object takes a −1 penalty to the AC it offers (armor) or to its attack rolls (weapon). Armor is destroyed if the penalty reduces its AC to 10, and a weapon is destroyed if its penalty reaches −5. The penalty can be removed by casting the Mending spell on the armor or weapon."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.101, 0.208, 0.473, 0.271], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Destroy Metal.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The rust monster touches a nonmagical metal object within 5 feet of itself that isn’t being worn or carried. The touch destroys a 1-foot Cube of the object."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.103, 0.279, 0.189, 0.295], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Reactions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.102, 0.299, 0.483, 0.332], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Reflexive Antennae.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Trigger: An attack roll hits the rust monster. Response: The rust monster uses Antennae."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.103, 0.34, 0.229, 0.364], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Sahuagin"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.103, 0.369, 0.298, 0.39], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Sahuagin Warrior"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.103, 0.392, 0.281, 0.408], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Medium Fiend, Lawful Evil"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.103, 0.413, 0.147, 0.428], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 12"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.277, 0.414, 0.392, 0.429], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " +0 (10)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.103, 0.429, 0.213, 0.444], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 22 (4d8 + 4)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.103, 0.445, 0.268, 0.46], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Speed", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 30 ft., Swim 40 ft."}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.104, 0.462, 0.487, 0.509], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.104, 0.462, 0.487, 0.509], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td></tr><tr><td>Str 13 +1 +1</td><td>Dex 11 +0 +0</td><td>Con12 +1 +1</td></tr><tr><td>Int 12 +1 +1</td><td>Wis 13 +1