dies if this reduces that score to 0. If a Humanoid is slain by this attack, a "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Shadow", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " rises from the corpse 1d4 hours later."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.102, 0.156, 0.228, 0.173], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Bonus Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.101, 0.177, 0.473, 0.211], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Shadow Stealth.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " While in Dim Light or Darkness, the shadow takes the Hide action."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.102, 0.217, 0.353, 0.242], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Shambling Mound"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.102, 0.247, 0.3, 0.269], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Shambling Mound"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.101, 0.272, 0.268, 0.338], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Large Plant, Unaligned "}, {"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 15 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 110 (13d10 + 39) "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Speed", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 30 ft., Swim 20 ft."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.276, 0.291, 0.383, 0.307], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative −1 (9)"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "table", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.104, 0.34, 0.487, 0.388], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.104, 0.34, 0.487, 0.388], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td></tr><tr><td>Str 18 +4 +4</td><td>Dex 8 -1 -1</td><td>Con16 +3 +3</td></tr><tr><td>Int 5 -3 -3</td><td>Wis 10 +0 +0</td><td>Cha 5 -3 -3</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.101, 0.397, 0.408, 0.49], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Skills", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Stealth +3 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Resistances", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Cold, Fire "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Immunities", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Lightning; Deafened, Exhaustion "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Senses", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Blindsight 60 ft.; Passive Perception 10 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " None "}, {"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 5 (XP 1,800; PB +3)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.102, 0.497, 0.156, 0.514], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Traits"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.101, 0.516, 0.49, 0.567], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Lightning Absorption", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": ". Whenever the shambling mound is subjected to Lightning damage, it regains a number of Hit Points equal to the Lightning damage dealt."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.102, 0.572, 0.173, 0.589], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.101, 0.592, 0.482, 0.641], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The shambling mound makes three Charged Tendril attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Engulf."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.101, 0.645, 0.478, 0.724], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Charged Tendril.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 10 ft. Hit: 7 (1d6 + 4) Bludgeoning damage plus 5 (2d4) Lightning damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, the shambling mound pulls the target 5 feet straight toward itself."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.1, 0.726, 0.484, 0.885], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Engulf.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Strength Saving Throw: DC 15, one Medium or smaller creature within 5 feet. Failure: The target is pulled into the shambling mound’s space and has the Grappled condition (escape DC 14). Until the grapple ends, the target has the Blinded and Restrained conditions, and it takes 10 (3d6) Lightning damage at the start of each of its turns. When the shambling mound moves, the Grappled target moves with it, costing it no extra movement. The shambling mound can have only one creature Grappled by this action at a time."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 16, "bbox": [0.524, 0.05, 0.748, 0.074], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Shield Guardian"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 17, "bbox": [0.524, 0.08, 0.701, 0.1], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Shield Guardian"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "table", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.522, 0.102, 0.909, 0.171], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 18, "bbox": [0.522, 0.102, 0.909, 0.171], "content": "<table><tr><td colspan=\"2\">Large Construct, Unaligned</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>AC 17 HP 142 (15d10 + 60)</td><td>Initiative -1 (9)</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Speed 30 ft.</td><td></td></tr></table>"}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.525, 0.173, 0.909, 0.221], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.525, 0.173, 0.909, 0.221], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td></tr><tr><td>Str 18 +4 +4</td><td>Dex 8 -1 -1</td><td>Con18 +4 +4</td></tr><tr><td>Int 7 -2 -2</td><td>Wis 10 +0 +0</td><td>Cha 3 -4 -4</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.524, 0.228, 0.88, 0.26], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Immunities", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Poison; Charmed, Exhaustion, Frightened, Paralyzed, Petrified, Poisoned"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.524, 0.26, 0.801, 0.29], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Senses", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Blindsight 10 ft., Darkvision 60 ft.; Passive Perception 10"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.524, 0.29, 0.907, 0.32], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Understands commands given in any language but can’t speak"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.524, 0.32, 0.681, 0.337], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 7 (XP 2,900; PB +3)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.524, 0.343, 0.579, 0.362], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Traits"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.522, 0.364, 0.91, 0.491], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Bound.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The guardian is magically bound to an amulet. While the guardian and its amulet are on the same plane of existence, the amulet’s wearer can telepathically call the guardian to travel to it, and the guardian knows the distance and direction to the amulet. If the guardian is within 60 feet of the amulet’s wearer, half of any damage the wearer takes (round up) is transferred to the guardian."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.522, 0.494, 0.91, 0.527], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Regeneration.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The guardian regains 10 Hit Points at the start of each of its turns if it has at least 1 Hit Point."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.521, 0.531, 0.904, 0.687], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Spell Storing.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " A spellcaster who wears the guardian’s amulet can cause the guardian to store one spell of level 4 or lower. To do so, the wearer must cast the spell on the guardian while within 5 feet of it. The spell has no effect but is stored within the guardian. Any previously stored spell is lost when a new spell is stored. The guardian can cast the spell stored with any parameters set by the original caster, requiring no spell components and using the caster’s spellcasting ability. The stored spell is then lost."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 28, "bbox": [0.524, 0.692, 0.595, 0.71], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 29, "bbox": [0.523, 0.713, 0.87, 0.731], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The guardian makes two Fist attacks."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 30, "bbox": [0.522, 0.734, 0.893, 0.768], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Fist.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +7, reach 10 ft. Hit: 11 (2d6 + 4) Bludgeoning damage plus 7 (2d6) Force damage."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 31, "bbox": [0.524, 0.773, 0.611, 0.791], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Reactions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 32, "bbox": [0.522, 0.794, 0.908, 0.889], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Protection.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Trigger: An attack roll hits the wearer of the guardian’s amulet while the wearer is within 5 feet of the guardian. Response: The wearer gains a +5 bonus to AC, including against the triggering attack and possibly causing it to miss, until the start of the guardian’s next turn."}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 33, "bbox": [0.028, 0.952, 0.062, 0.968], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "323"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 34, "bbox": [0.102, 0.951, 0.375, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "System Reference Document 5.2.1"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 323, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.102, 0.065, 0.31, 0.091], "content": [{"ty