 After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.522, 0.163, 0.898, 0.226], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Spellcasting.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The dragon casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 23, +15 to hit with spell attacks):"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.524, 0.229, 0.909, 0.307], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "At Will:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Detect Magic, Hold Monster, Ice Knife (level 2 version), Shapechange (Beast or Humanoid form only, no Temporary Hit Points gained from the spell, and no Concentration or Temporary Hit Points required to maintain the spell)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.525, 0.307, 0.889, 0.338], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1/Day Each:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Control Weather, Ice Storm (level 7 version), Teleport, Zone of Truth"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.524, 0.346, 0.684, 0.363], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Legendary Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.522, 0.364, 0.893, 0.417], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Legendary Action Uses: 3 (4 in Lair). Immediately after another creature’s turn, the dragon can expend a use to take one of the following actions. The dragon regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.522, 0.421, 0.899, 0.469], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Chill.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The dragon uses Spellcasting to cast Hold Monster. The dragon can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.522, 0.472, 0.903, 0.566], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Cold Gale.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 23, each creature in a 60-foot-long, 10-foot-wide Line. Failure: 14 (4d6) Cold damage, and the target is pushed up to 30 feet straight away from the dragon. Success: Half damage only. Failure or Success: The dragon can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.522, 0.57, 0.901, 0.602], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Pounce.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The dragon moves up to half its Speed, and it makes one Rend attack."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.524, 0.611, 0.663, 0.633], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Skeletons"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 28, "bbox": [0.524, 0.64, 0.624, 0.66], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Skeleton"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 29, "bbox": [0.524, 0.663, 0.719, 0.679], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Medium Undead, Lawful Evil"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 30, "bbox": [0.524, 0.685, 0.571, 0.699], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 14"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 31, "bbox": [0.699, 0.685, 0.812, 0.7], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " +3 (13)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 32, "bbox": [0.524, 0.7, 0.633, 0.714], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "HP", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 13 (2d8 + 4)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 33, "bbox": [0.525, 0.716, 0.608, 0.731], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Speed", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 30 ft."}]}, {"type": "table", "index": 34, "bbox": [0.525, 0.732, 0.91, 0.78], "content": [{"type": "table_body", "index": 34, "bbox": [0.525, 0.732, 0.91, 0.78], "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td><td>MOD SAVE</td></tr><tr><td>Str 10 +0 +0</td><td>Dex 16 +3 +3</td