524, 0.275, 0.832, 0.321], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Senses", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Truesight 120 ft.; Passive Perception 24 "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Languages", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " All; telepathy 120 ft. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "CR", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 21 (XP 33,000; PB +7)"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 36, "bbox": [0.524, 0.329, 0.578, 0.347], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Traits"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 37, "bbox": [0.524, 0.351, 0.879, 0.368], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Divine Awareness.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The solar knows if it hears a lie."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 38, "bbox": [0.522, 0.372, 0.898, 0.434], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Exalted Restoration.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " If the solar dies outside Mount Celestia, its body disappears, and it gains a new body instantly, reviving with all its Hit Points somewhere in Mount Celestia."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 39, "bbox": [0.523, 0.439, 0.908, 0.471], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Legendary Resistance (4/Day).", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " If the solar fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 40, "bbox": [0.523, 0.475, 0.896, 0.509], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Magic Resistance.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The solar has Advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 41, "bbox": [0.524, 0.514, 0.594, 0.531], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 42, "bbox": [0.523, 0.535, 0.908, 0.568], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The solar makes two Flying Sword attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Slaying Bow."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 43, "bbox": [0.522, 0.571, 0.912, 0.651], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Flying Sword.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee or Ranged Attack Roll: +15, reach 10 ft. or range 120 ft. Hit: 22 (4d6 + 8) Slashing damage plus 36 (8d8) Radiant damage. Hit or Miss: The sword magically returns to the solar’s hand or hovers within 5 feet of the solar immediately after a ranged attack."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 44, "bbox": [0.522, 0.654, 0.907, 0.733], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Slaying Bow.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 21, one creature the solar can see within 600 feet. Failure: If the creature has 100 Hit Points or fewer, it dies. It otherwise takes 24 (4d8 + 6) Piercing damage plus 36 (8d8) Radiant damage."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 45, "bbox": [0.522, 0.736, 0.91, 0.785], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Spellcasting.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The solar casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 25):"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 46, "bbox": [0.524, 0.788, 0.739, 0.804], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "At Will:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Detect Evil and Good"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 47, "bbox": [0.524, 0.804, 0.892, 0.836], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1/Day Each:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Commune, Control Weather, Dispel Evil and Good, Resurrection"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 48, "bbox": [0.524, 0.842, 0.65, 0.86], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Bonus Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 49, "bbox": [0.522, 0.863, 0.91, 0.913], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Divine Aid (3/Day).", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The solar casts Cure Wounds (level 2 version), Lesser Restoration, or Remove Curse, using the same spellcasting ability as Spellcasting."}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 50, "bbox": [0.028, 0.952, 0.062, 0.968], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "326"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 51, "bbox": [0.103, 0.951, 0.374, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "System Reference Document 5.2.1"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 326, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.103, 0.051, 0.262, 0.069], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Legendary Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.101, 0.07, 0.481, 0.122], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Legendary Action Uses: 3. Immediately after another creature’s turn, the solar can expend a use to take one of the following actions. The solar regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.101, 0.126, 0.488, 0.204], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Blinding Gaze.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Constitution Saving Throw: DC 25, one creature the solar can see within 120 feet. Failure: The target has the Blinded condition for 1 minute. Failure or Success: The solar can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.101, 0.208, 0.49, 0.288], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Radiant Teleport.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The solar teleports up to 60 feet to an unoccupied space it can see. Dexterity Saving Throw: DC 25, each creature in a 10-foot Emanation originating from the solar at its destination space. Failure: 11 (2d10) Radiant damage. Success: Half damage."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.103, 0.295, 0.216, 0.32], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Specter"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.104, 0.325, 0.192, 0.345], "content": [