n observe the sphinx remotely or detect its thoughts without its permission. Wisdom (Insight) checks made to ascertain its intentions or sincerity are made with Disadvantage."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 19, "bbox": [0.522, 0.05, 0.885, 0.097], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Legendary Resistance (3/Day, or 4/Day in Lair).", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " If the sphinx fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 20, "bbox": [0.524, 0.104, 0.595, 0.121], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 21, "bbox": [0.522, 0.125, 0.893, 0.157], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Multiattack.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The sphinx makes two Claw attacks and uses Roar."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 22, "bbox": [0.523, 0.161, 0.895, 0.194], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Claw.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +12, reach 5 ft. Hit: 20 (4d6 + 6) Slashing damage."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 23, "bbox": [0.522, 0.198, 0.902, 0.246], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Roar (3/Day).", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The sphinx emits a magical roar. Whenever it roars, the roar has a different effect, as detailed below (the sequence resets when it takes a Long Rest):"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 24, "bbox": [0.524, 0.25, 0.904, 0.311], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "First Roar.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 20, each enemy in a 500-foot Emanation originating from the sphinx. Failure: The target has the Frightened condition for 1 minute."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 25, "bbox": [0.524, 0.311, 0.901, 0.403], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Second Roar.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 20, each enemy in a 500-foot Emanation originating from the sphinx. Failure: The target has the Paralyzed condition, and it repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 26, "bbox": [0.524, 0.404, 0.896, 0.481], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Third Roar.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Constitution Saving Throw: DC 20, each enemy in a 500-foot Emanation originating from the sphinx. Failure: 44 (8d10) Thunder damage, and the target has the Prone condition. Success: Half damage only."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 27, "bbox": [0.522, 0.486, 0.895, 0.534], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Spellcasting.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The sphinx casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Wisdom as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 20):"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 28, "bbox": [0.523, 0.537, 0.901, 0.584], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "At Will:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Detect Evil and Good, Thaumaturgy "}, {"type": "text", "content": "1/Day Each:", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Detect Magic, Dispel Magic, Greater Restoration, Heroes’ Feast, Zone of Truth"}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 29, "bbox": [0.524, 0.592, 0.684, 0.609], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Legendary Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 30, "bbox": [0.522, 0.611, 0.89, 0.663], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Legendary Action Uses: 3 (4 in Lair). Immediately after another creature’s turn, the sphinx can expend a use to take one of the following actions. The sphinx regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 31, "bbox": [0.522, 0.667, 0.889, 0.714], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Arcane Prowl.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The sphinx can teleport up to 30 fee