dies only if it starts its turn with 0 Hit Points and doesn’t regenerate."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 41, "bbox": [0.522, 0.72, 0.896, 0.783], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Troll Spawn.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " The limb uncannily has the same senses as a whole troll. If the limb isn’t destroyed within 24 hours, roll 1d12. On a 12, the limb turns into a "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Troll", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": ". Otherwise, the limb withers away."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 42, "bbox": [0.524, 0.789, 0.594, 0.806], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Actions"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 43, "bbox": [0.522, 0.81, 0.896, 0.844], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Rend.", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 9 (2d4 + 4) Slashing damage."}]}, {"type": "page_number", "index": 44, "bbox": [0.028, 0.952, 0.061, 0.968], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "333"}]}, {"type": "footer", "index": 45, "bbox": [0.103, 0.951, 0.374, 0.969], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "System Reference Document 5.2.1"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 333, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.103, 0.05, 0.219, 0.074], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Unicorn"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.104, 0.08, 0.195, 0.1], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Unicorn"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.103, 0.103, 0.296, 0.12], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Large Celestial, Lawful Good"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.103, 0.124, 0.148, 0.139], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "AC", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " 12"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.276, 0.125, 0.392, 0.14], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Initiative", "styles": ["bold"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " +8 (18)"}]}, 